<p dir="auto">This PR adds a new page to our list of "attacks", this one is on JavaScript Prototype Pollution.</p>
<p dir="auto">Generally, I'm not sure if I covered everything that needs to appear here. I think I'm somewhat happy about the defenses part, but explaining how to actually get into to polluting objects might need some more words?</p>
<p dir="auto">Also, I think this needs integration into JS docs (at a minimum some linkage).</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Developing a series of guides about common attacks on websites, explaining for each attack: how it works, the impact, and how to defend against it.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Would love some feedback from <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wbamberg/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wbamberg">@wbamberg</a>, <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/aaronshim/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/aaronshim">@aaronshim</a> and maybe <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena">@Josh-Cena</a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto">None, I think.</p>]]></content>
